+### Continuous advisor on construction
+
+`aidlc-developer-agent` carries `advisor: true`, so when Coding Harness's
+advisor subsystem is on (`advisor.enabled: true`) a second model watches the
+developer turn by turn instead of waiting for the stage gate. It reviews against
+what the human approved: the adapter contributes `.harness-aidlc/host/watchdog/WATCHDOG.md`
+(the review brief) and, while a workflow is active, a generated
+`<record>/.aidlc-engine/harness/WATCHDOG.md` that inlines the approved stages'
+artifacts (up to 24 KiB; larger ones are listed by path for the advisor to read).
+When a change does what its assignment says but contradicts an approved artifact,
+the advisor names the artifact and section.
+
+The advisor runs on Coding Harness's `advisor` model role; point that role at
+another vendor to combine this with cross-vendor review. `task.agentAdvisor`
+turns it off or picks a model per agent.
+
 ## Alongside Claude Code
 
 One project can carry both distributions: run `aidlc config --harness claude`
